    "text": "<p>m-chlorobenzaldehyde on treatment with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KOH</mi></math> solution yields</p>",
